+/**
+ * Every `.hbs` the website module names must EXIST on disk, in both locales
+ * (WP3a final review, Minor 12). `EmailService.renderTemplate` does not throw
+ * on a missing file — it warns and sends `<p>{{message}}</p>`, which looks like
