+ *
+ *   - the newsletter confirm + welcome pair, named as string literals in
+ *     `website-newsletter.service.ts` (read from the source, so a rename there
+ *     is caught here);
+ *   - `website-forms-unavailable`, named by the registry entry
+ *     `EVENT_REGISTRY.WEBSITE_FORMS_UNAVAILABLE.emailTemplate`.
+ *
+ * The directory is the one `EmailService` reads in dev (`src/modules/email/
+ * templates`); the prod image copies the same folder (nest-cli assets).
+ */
